  "subtitle": "Roasted vegetables, fig and halloumi with chestnut stuffing",
  "description": "A festive vegetarian traybake combining crisp roast vegetables, spiced aubergine, figs, halloumi, and savory chestnut stuffing with cranberry sauce.",
